# The judged set of stack-enforcer checklist lines that name a DDD building block
# or a framework annotation without citing the brief. verify-harness's enforcer-pin
# step compares the live set (code-quality-review and design-validation under
# harness/stacks/<stack>/) against this file, line for line.
# Every line here was judged a closed-kernel check or framework wiring, never a
# tactic the brief owns (ADR 2026-06-26 open-closed DDD; audit-agents' open-closed
# check names the line). A new line fails the battery until it is judged: cite the
# brief in the line, or add it here as an explicit decision. Hand-curated; no script
# regenerates it.
generic/design-validation: - [ ] Aggregates are the consistency boundary: entered only through the root, referenced by identity
generic/design-validation: - [ ] Anti-corruption guards every boundary the project does not control; an owned, closely-tracked model may be mapped directly
generic/design-validation: - [ ] Value objects immutable, equal by value; invariants enforced at construction
go/design-validation: - [ ] Aggregates are the consistency boundary: entered only through the root, referenced by identity
go/design-validation: - [ ] Anti-corruption guards every boundary the project does not control; an owned, closely-tracked model may be mapped directly
go/design-validation: - [ ] Value objects immutable, equal by value; invariants enforced at construction
java-spring-boot/code-quality-review: - [ ] Constructor injection (implicit with single constructor, no `@Autowired`)
java-spring-boot/code-quality-review: - [ ] `@ConditionalOnProperty` for optional components
java-spring-boot/design-validation: - [ ] Aggregates are the consistency boundary: entered only through the root, referenced by identity
java-spring-boot/design-validation: - [ ] Anti-corruption guards every boundary the project does not control; an owned, closely-tracked model may be mapped directly
java-spring-boot/design-validation: - [ ] Value objects immutable, equal by value; invariants enforced at construction
